cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Reflexive Agents: a self-healing loop for AI agent hallucination"
abstract: >-
  A closed loop that detects an agent's Tool, Arg and Loop hallucinations, fixes them with a
  teacher's verified trajectories, retrains a LoRA adapter, and keeps it only if it passes a gate.
  On the τ²-bench test split, healing took Aya Expanse 32B from 14.5% to 51.5% of tasks solved.
